senses.gloss:
निम्बू(क)
(1) a) CITRUS MEDICA LINN. = C. ACIDA PERS. (Ainslie 1, p. 193-194;
Bpn, p. 580; Dgv, nr. 68; MW; Na 1, nr. 96);
b) [C. MEDICA LINN. VAR. ACIDA] (Dutt; KB 1, p. 489-490; Vśs;
Watt CP, p. 326); see Cooke 1, p. 200-201; Duthie 1, p. 131-
132; Hooker 1, p. 514-515;
(2) [C. LIMON (LINN.) BURM. F.] (Chopra: महानिम्बु); see Purseglove
2, p. 502-504; = [C. MEDICA LINN. VAR. LIMONUM] (Chopra); see Cooke
1, p. 200-201; Duthie 1, p. 131; Hooker 1, p. 514-515; Watt CP, p.
325-326;
[]
(3) CITRUS AURANTIUM LINN. = C. BERGAMIA RISSO (KB 1, p. 494-
495) = [C. AURANTIUM LINN. VAR. BERGAMIA] (KB 1, p. 494-495); see
Hooker 1, p. 515; see about निम्बू: H. W. Glidden, The lemon in
Asia and Europe, JAOS 57, 1937, p. 381-396.
